<title>FRANCE: Air Inter Europe cuts Thurs flights due to strike.</title>
<headline>Air Inter Europe cuts Thurs flights due to strike.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Inter Europe said it would only be able to assure 110 flights out of its total of 500 on Thursday due to a public sector strike also involving air controllers.</p>
<p>The DGAC aviation authority is assuring a minimum service on Thursday, affecting domestic flights but not fly-overs.</p>
</text>
